      "content": [
        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Review result: incomplete—cost-event evidence is restricted\n\nI verified the relevant work order and September Pending Close time, but **cannot determine whether a cost event was created afterward** from the records available to my role.\n\n| Requested item | Finding |\n|---|---|\n| Manufacturing order | **MO-25-09-1070** |\n| Work order ID | **WO-2025-09-004** |\n| Operation / product | Modine Racine–Dekoven / Cooler Plate Pack |\n| Cost period | **Sep-25 — PER-COST-2025-09** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** — source does not specify a time zone |\n| Source transaction | Not verifiable |\n| Event amount | Not verifiable |\n| Exact event-created time | Not verifiable |\n| Minutes after Pending Close | Cannot calculate without the event-created timestamp |\n| Recorded accounting status | Not verifiable |\n| Status consistent with Oracle policy? | **Undetermined** |\n\nThe accessible Task records contain work orders and cost periods, but **no cost-event rows**. Access to the supporting records returned **403: source role not granted**. I requested authorized disclosure and escalated the blocker; I did not bypass the restriction. This evidence gap does **not** establish that no late event occurred.\n\n### Applicable Oracle treatment\n\nThe supplied *Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B* documentation, “Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting” (printed page 225; PDF page 233), states that newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened. **Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions** that continue processing.\n\nAn authorized cost-event extract—including transaction ID, amount, event type, creation timestamp, and recorded accounting status—is therefore required to calculate lateness and reach a defensible consistency conclusion.\n\n**No database records were changed.** The partial audit and provenance were saved, and the submitted report is marked **needs evidence**.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
    }
  ],
